    "body": "## Motivation\nOn XPU, PyTorch inductor's static Triton launcher segfaults loading some compiled kernels (seen with the compiled repetition penalty), killing the scheduler. `test_vision_openai_server_a` (LLaVA) fails on XPU because of it.\n\n## Modifications\n`engine.py`: on XPU only, `os.environ.setdefault(\"TORCHINDUCTOR_USE_STATIC_CUDA_LAUNCHER\", \"0\")` before workers spawn. A user-set value is respected. No change on other devices.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\nNo model-output change. `test_vision_openai_server_a::TestLlavaServer` video_images and multi_images pass on Arc Pro B60 (together with #48359).\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\nN/A. Only the kernel launch path changes, and only on XPU.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41800293823](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800293823)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41800293828](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800293828)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41800293995](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41800293995)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
